# Anthropic Claude API Key (Optional)
# If provided, live Claude 3.5 Sonnet/Haiku will power AI Insights & "Ask Your Data".
# If left blank, VITAL's intelligent internal analytical engine will provide real-time data insights automatically.
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
